<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center" class="tborder" style="border-bottom: 0;">
	<tr class="titlebg">
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="15%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/topic/veryhot_post.gif" alt="" />
			Author
		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: Omens of War - Will you Buy it? &nbsp;(Read 1130 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402" title="View the profile of Callon">Callon</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 299<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg10420#msg10420"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg10420#msg10420">Re: Omens of War - Will you Buy it?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #15 on:</b> August 24, 2004, 01:08:22 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							heh... yeah, I was one of the early complainers.&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/bitching.gif" alt="Bitching" border="0" />&nbsp; It kind of amused me -- after being told by some high end raiders that I should shut up, the expansion wasn&#039;t for people like me, it was primarily for people who&#039;d finished Plane of Time, blah blah -- that the high end game turned out to be full of problems too.&nbsp; Pretty soon they were quitting EQ in droves over the Uqua cockblock and other stupidities.&nbsp; <br /><br />Truth be told some zones have been made a bit easier to tank in GoD, but Tipt/Vxed are still stupidly designed.&nbsp; The trash is tougher than much of the trash in Kod&#039;Taz, the zone you&#039;re trying to get flagged for with them.&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm13.gif" alt="cwm13" border="0" />&nbsp; And most groups still end up doing these trials by tagging along behind a chanter charmed pet and trying not to fall asleep.<br /><br />I&#039;ll buy Omens of War, so I suppose none of my complaints about GoD really matter.&nbsp; Sony will still get my money.&nbsp; I haven&#039;t pre-ordered yet though because they always screw people on the pre-orders.&nbsp; I&#039;m not convinced the devs have learned much since the clusterfook that was GoD though.<br /><br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10425"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=57" title="View the profile of Givins">Givins</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 116<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://mark.scns.com/eq/givins.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Illuminating mobs since 2001<br />
								<br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=5226347" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=5226347&amp;img=5" alt="5226347" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=57"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:ktadema@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg10425#msg10425"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg10425#msg10425">Re: Omens of War - Will you Buy it?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #16 on:</b> August 24, 2004, 08:08:36 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							When the POP expansion came out, the level cap was raised to 65.&nbsp; Many of us, myself included, leveled quickly, only to find that the world shrank considerably.&nbsp; No longer could you grind in Sebilis, various Luclin zones, etc.&nbsp; The feeling that I had that I was now essentially trapped to grinding in POP was horrible to me.&nbsp; Now I realize that this was eventually &quot;fixed&quot; by increasing the range at which levels 65&#039;s see dark blue mobs, but I fear that OOW will create this same scenario.&nbsp; I am not interested in turning level 70 only to find out that I&#039;m forced to grind tier 2 pop or GoD or OOW while the rest of EQ is useless to me. <br /><br />I will be waiting until after OOW is released, and my fears are alleviated, before I purchase this expansion.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Klozz 65th level Warrior, Givins N&#039;Takhiens, 65th level Wizard
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10426"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=579" title="View the profile of Retrievil">Retrievil</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 19<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.hegemonyguild.com/forums/images/avatars/13170030164036b29d4f23c.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Officer of Hegemony<br />
