	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10447"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402" title="View the profile of Callon">Callon</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 299<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg10447#msg10447"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg10447#msg10447">Re: Omens of War - Will you Buy it?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #18 on:</b> August 25, 2004, 01:41:34 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Now I realize that this was eventually &quot;fixed&quot; by increasing the range at which levels 65&#039;s see dark blue mobs</div><br />But it wasn&#039;t fixed.&nbsp; There is about a 100% exp bonus for killing mobs within 5 levels of you.&nbsp; So if you want decent exp at L65, you need to hunt where the mobs are L60+.&nbsp; Every mob below 60 is hurting your exp rate.&nbsp; Now when OoW comes out we&#039;ll be able to go to 70.&nbsp; That means you&#039;ll want all L65+ mobs to get good exp.&nbsp; So the first 3 tiers of PoP become all but useless for exp grinds.&nbsp; Obviously pre-PoP is out, but it already was.&nbsp; In GoD, Tipt/Vxed and Kod&#039;Taz will still be decent, though even they have a number of mobs below L65.&nbsp; They&#039;ll be great to L68 or 69 and then start to drop a bit, but the advantage of more levels should make up for the small drop.&nbsp; It won&#039;t make up for it in tier 1-3 PoP as almost everything is below L65.&nbsp; <br /><br />At L70 more people will get their sol ro and elem flags.&nbsp; Slowly more will creep into Kod&#039;Taz.&nbsp; I expect the elems, sol ro, and KT to be very busy grind areas as everything lower will suck for exp and higher stuff is still beyond many people to reach.&nbsp; That means a few good grind zones plus whatever the new expansion has to offer.... for the entire EQ L70 population minus some hardcore raiders that may find higher flagged areas to grind.&nbsp; <br /><br />This is why i get the feeling the new level cap is going to suck.&nbsp; Omens of War better have a ton of good grind zones for L70.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
