								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg10483#msg10483">Re: Omens of War - Will you Buy it?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #23 on:</b> August 26, 2004, 01:16:39 pm &#187;</span></td>
