							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Ability: Call of the Wild<br />Description: This ability allows you to call a fallen comrade&#039;s spirit back to their corpse. This resurrection does not restore any lost experience, but the player can still get an experience resurrection after being affected by this ability.</div><br />For druids and shaman.
						</td>
					</tr>
