							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg10507#msg10507"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1047.msg10507#msg10507">Re: Omens of War - Will you Buy it?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #25 on:</b> August 26, 2004, 06:36:26 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I won&#039;t buy it immediately...I&#039;d rather let SOE work out some of the &quot;bugs&quot; and put through a few patches before I&#039;ll commit.  <br /><br />Extremely excited about Call of the Wild (Druid summon/rez) <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" />.  Maybe we&#039;ll be able to get a chance to group in LDON groups more often <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/clapper.gif" alt="clapper" border="0" />
						</td>
